### Base Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8086/api/v1/search/products

### 1. Get Product by Product ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/11
Accept: application/json

###

### 2. Get Product by Non-Existent or Inactive Product ID (Returns 404 Not Found)
GET {{baseUrl}}/99999
Accept: application/json

###

### 3. Search Products by Name (Fuzzy Match)
GET {{baseUrl}}/by-name?name=Nokia&page=0&size=10
Accept: application/json

###

### 4. Search Products by Name with Typos (e.g., 'iphne' matches 'iphone')
GET {{baseUrl}}/by-name?name=iphne&page=0&size=5
Accept: application/json